  moveName: Electroweb
  description: "Send a curved electric net forward, marking each enemy caught for
    4s and dealing damage every 0.6s. Hitting a marked enemy with a direct move
    grants 30% movement speed for 1s. This boost refreshes rather than stacks;
    basic attacks and periodic damage do not trigger it. Full Volt Absorb is
    consumed to cast a wider net. Upgrade extends marks to 5s and the movement-speed
    boost to 1.5s."
